{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"agent_message","text":"The power-of-two cases admit a stronger exact optimization: scaling before the FFT is only an exponent shift, so I fused that shift with zero-padding in one Triton pass. Local checks are bit-for-bit identical; this especially targets the two largest workloads. I’m validating the mixed path across the full suite now."}}
